    "title": "Anidación de condicionales",
    "descriptionContent": "Aprende a anidar otros bloques de código como declaraciones condicionales dentro de funciones.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17462,
        "title": "Anidación de condicionales",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Es hora de crear funciones que tomen decisiones. Como primer paso, veamos cómo anidar declaraciones condicionales dentro de funciones.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sabemos que las funciones son bloques de código. Eso significa que las instrucciones anidadas están rodeadas por llaves y tienen espacio extra en el lado izquierdo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{</code> seguido de <code>console.log(message);</code> y finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos agregar otros bloques de código dentro de una función. Cuando hacemos eso, el par adicional de llaves nos permite saber qué instrucciones pertenecen a dónde.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{</code> seguido de <code>{</code> y luego <code>}</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El espacio a la izquierda se llama <strong>indentación</strong>. Cuando añadimos un bloque de código dentro de otro, todo el bloque de código se indenta por un espacio.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"eventName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (eventName === \" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn sound!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound(\" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>if (eventName === \"spawn\") {</code> seguido de <code>console.log(\"Spawn sound!\");</code> y finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Envolver declaraciones <code>if</code> dentro de funciones nos ayuda a organizar y reutilizar nuestro código. Ahora, podemos usar la misma declaración <code>if</code> con una llamada a función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>canEnterBossRoom</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las instrucciones fuera de los bloques de código anidados aún se ejecutan, incluso si el código dentro de la declaración condicional se omite.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué sucede cuando añadimos una declaración <code>if</code> dentro de una función?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Estamos añadiendo un bloque de código dentro de otro bloque de código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La función omitirá el bloque <code>if</code> cuando se llame</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Estamos añadiendo un bloque de código dentro de otro bloque de código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántas instrucciones fuera de la declaración <code>if</code> tiene esta función?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una declaración de visualización</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ninguna, todas las instrucciones son parte de la declaración <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una declaración de visualización.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo se llama el espacio a la izquierda de una instrucción anidada?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indentación</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un bloque de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir Indentación.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué es útil envolver condicionales dentro de funciones?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nos ayuda a organizar y reutilizar nuestro código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No lo es, es lo mismo que reescribir una declaración <code>if</code> cada vez que la necesitamos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nos ayuda a organizar y reutilizar nuestro código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué declaración de visualización se ejecuta al llamar a <code>checkCollision(false)</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkCollision\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"colliding\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collision system running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (colliding === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No collision&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkCollision(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambas declaraciones de visualización se ejecutan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo se ejecuta la segunda declaración de display</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ambas declaraciones de visualización se ejecutan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anida la declaración <code>if</code> dentro de la función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"xp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (xp &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{</code> seguido de <code>{</code> y luego <code>}</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra solo <code>\"Checking XP\"</code> en la consola colocándolo fuera de la declaración <code>if</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isGameOver\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checking health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isGameOver(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Checking health\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Game Over\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra ambos mensajes en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"alive\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (alive === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is alive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aumenta <code>health</code> en 50 si es menos de 100. Muestra <code>health</code> al final de la función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  health = health + \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>health = health + 50;</code> seguido de <code>console.log(health);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Reduce el <code>score</code> en 500 solo si es mayor que 2100.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyPenalty\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  score = score - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = applyPenalty(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}